      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "でも、飛空艇を直すための指揮なら、\r\n視力が衰えてもできるだろ？",
        "official_en": "But even if your eyesight isn’t what it used be, you can always direct people to do your work.",
        "real_en": "But you could still direct airship repairs even with your eyesight failing, couldn't you?"
      },
