        "official_en_sha256": "5e0594999b8fb1ee58a29c64aa4ee230b95559d8c894160c4bbfa45ca3e9feb5"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "バカなことを言うな。\r\n俺に指揮など務まるものか。",
        "official_en": "Don’t be ridiculous. I can’t do that—even <text style=\"italic\">if</> my condition doesn’t get any worse.",
        "real_en": "Don't be ridiculous. There's no way I could take charge."
