        "key": "SubEv_C01_Rain_05_009",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Rain_05:SubEv_C01_Rain_05_009:f733726f",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Rain_05:SubEv_C01_Rain_05_009:f733726f",
        "jp_sha256": "f3027b2283ca046ee6ef712371e83230725c329eb490c9d362084b0c9a0f6f68",
        "official_en_sha256": "937d2f09e937cfbe7b60c8061f5026b90a81da5d14cc34cae07b4c574a952c02"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "バカ野郎……。\r\n今、グランシェルトは大変なときだろう。\r\n俺一人にかまっている場合か。",
        "official_en": "You crazy bastard... Why go through all this trouble for me when Grandshelt needs you now more than ever?",
        "real_en": "You idiot... Grandshelt is in trouble right now. Is this really the time to be worrying about just me?"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
